{"id":5634,"date":"2025-09-09T13:39:05","date_gmt":"2025-09-09T06:39:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=5634"},"modified":"2025-09-25T20:28:54","modified_gmt":"2025-09-25T13:28:54","slug":"cach-tai-shopee-tren-may-tinh","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-shopee\/cach-tai-shopee-tren-may-tinh\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i Shopee tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh: 2 Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p nhanh ch\u00f3ng"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"RfhJd9yvJoW1idxuA1Gl54nzgmh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HImQdAAGvoELJuxzvQHlafLWgGe\">Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Shopee tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh l\u1edbn kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua xem s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u01a1n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n vi\u1ec7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n, c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p t\u1eeb <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> s\u1ebd l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00e1ng c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y s\u1ebd h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i Shopee tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh qua hai ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p nhanh ch\u00f3ng nh\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OgFLdhGk7oMvSbxzgQrlyCYegFd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-NlLYdam8UokYhHxCNAjlSNvxgWe\">T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean t\u1ea3i Shopee v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh?<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KJlodjZskoaMBWxD4xWlDJVSgce\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5635\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5635\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5635\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-sao-nen-tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean t\u1ea3i Shopee v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh?\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-sao-nen-tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-sao-nen-tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-sao-nen-tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-sao-nen-tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Tai-sao-nen-tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5635\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>T\u1ea1i sao n\u00ean t\u1ea3i Shopee v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh?<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"RfhJd9yvJoW1idxuA1Gl54nzgmh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DPMJdTscxoWgInx2SrhlXRkhgCd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BfhEdDKfqo00gSx4ovll2NzogNb\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Shopee tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m tho\u1ea3i m\u00e1i h\u01a1n v\u1edbi m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh l\u1edbn, gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n xem h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m chi ti\u1ebft v\u00e0 r\u00f5 n\u00e9t. Thao t\u00e1c t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, so s\u00e1nh v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gi\u1ecf h\u00e0ng c\u0169ng tr\u1edf n\u00ean nhanh ch\u00f3ng h\u01a1n v\u1edbi chu\u1ed9t v\u00e0 b\u00e0n ph\u00edm. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n, vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng, tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi tin nh\u1eafn kh\u00e1ch v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh s\u1ebd hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n r\u1ea5t nhi\u1ec1u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1EjdMeEToS70IxF2Jjlrj28g75\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KZD8d4onzoZOOoxeooSlhbTygzq\">C\u00e1ch 1: T\u1ea3i Shopee v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1eb1ng Google Chrome<\/h2>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IaGDdwiy3oh0eWx9RAHljFBcgXc\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5636\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5636\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5636\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-1-Tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-bang-Google-Chrome.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch 1: T\u1ea3i Shopee v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1eb1ng Google Chrome\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-1-Tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-bang-Google-Chrome.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-1-Tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-bang-Google-Chrome-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-1-Tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-bang-Google-Chrome-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-1-Tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-bang-Google-Chrome-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-1-Tai-Shopee-ve-may-tinh-bang-Google-Chrome-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5636\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00e1ch 1: T\u1ea3i Shopee v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh b\u1eb1ng Google Chrome<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TPsnddLfEoTr2rxulAYlVds7gjh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XGWVdy7b9oGjmPx4zaRlTYHtgjb\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, nh\u1eb9 nh\u00e0ng v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng nh\u1ea5t, bi\u1ebfn trang web Shopee th\u00e0nh m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-IHeDdyyw7olgAaxHuTslmAN4gbh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp trang ch\u1ee7 Shopee b\u1eb1ng tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t Chrome<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Itl9dvm5KoJMEuxWdtFl2KNCgmc\">\u0110\u1ea7u ti\u00ean, h\u00e3y m\u1edf tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t Google Chrome tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Sau \u0111\u00f3, truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a Shopee Vi\u1ec7t Nam l\u00e0 shopee.vn.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EQYGdAQpxoui9Nxtk9GlDPkYgyd\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng &#8220;C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t&#8221; c\u1ee7a Chrome<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IUWzdXQpeoSvaFxGLgXlFcsFgbd\">T\u1ea1i trang ch\u1ee7 Shopee, h\u00e3y nh\u00ecn l\u00ean g\u00f3c ph\u1ea3i c\u1ee7a thanh \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 (n\u01a1i b\u1ea1n g\u00f5 t\u00ean trang web). B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd th\u1ea5y m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng nh\u1ecf h\u00ecnh m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u00f3 m\u0169i t\u00ean t\u1ea3i xu\u1ed1ng, h\u00e3y nh\u1ea5p v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 v\u00e0 ch\u1ecdn <strong>&#8220;C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t&#8221; (Install)<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Q9cWdnjROorEqQxomNvlDISAgyc\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Truy c\u1eadp Shopee nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqJqdlOSZowoKaxpiVwlDaXMgeb\">Sau khi c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t, m\u1ed9t bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng Shopee s\u1ebd xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh Desktop ho\u1eb7c trong menu Start c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Gi\u1edd \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 m\u1edf Shopee trong m\u1ed9t c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 ri\u00eang bi\u1ec7t, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 thanh \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 hay c\u00e1c tab kh\u00e1c, mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m gi\u1ed1ng nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng th\u1ef1c th\u1ee5.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Znmydccb8oeCuvx9zqil4gCqgbh\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-IYtcdPEQdoyUl0x2t1alhICfgfb\">C\u00e1ch 2: T\u1ea3i Shopee b\u1eb1ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WkUgdE9RfodVWsx36Pdl4fd5gyJ\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MvumdXL9loiCTkxjaIvlfDMugSe\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;511ca057-fa1a-47c5-bb61-047e7de2f945&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEJSpbfCqvo31thxEOjIloGMPgMd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EJSpbfCqvo31thxEOjIloGMPgMd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:708378,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5637\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5637\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5637\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-2-Tai-Shopee-bang-phan-mem-gia-lap-Android.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch 2: T\u1ea3i Shopee b\u1eb1ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-2-Tai-Shopee-bang-phan-mem-gia-lap-Android.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-2-Tai-Shopee-bang-phan-mem-gia-lap-Android-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-2-Tai-Shopee-bang-phan-mem-gia-lap-Android-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-2-Tai-Shopee-bang-phan-mem-gia-lap-Android-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Cach-2-Tai-Shopee-bang-phan-mem-gia-lap-Android-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5637\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>C\u00e1ch 2: T\u1ea3i Shopee b\u1eb1ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YfkidRObOoX4dPxnNR6lVWAbgDd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZgeLdVJ69ovSeRxqofrlkeDQgWh\">Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p n\u00e0y s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfc \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i Android \u1ea3o tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n, cho ph\u00e9p b\u1ea1n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee y h\u1ec7t nh\u01b0 tr\u00ean di \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-A8Gldqw1ioEzkdx2g5dloogMgNe\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea3i v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XPWod63kNoz0e7xzdtllB2fFged\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-MKNidTfBhoHf1XxOunflRZ2cg6b\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5fc366fe-fe16-4894-b974-e9f125a88bf1&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVCeWbO6x4o71text5pPlqAywglc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VCeWbO6x4o71text5pPlqAywglc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:530405,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5638\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5638\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5638\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Tai-va-cai-dat-mot-phan-mem-gia-lap-Vi-du-NoxPlayer.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea3i v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp (V\u00ed d\u1ee5 NoxPlayer)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Tai-va-cai-dat-mot-phan-mem-gia-lap-Vi-du-NoxPlayer.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Tai-va-cai-dat-mot-phan-mem-gia-lap-Vi-du-NoxPlayer-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Tai-va-cai-dat-mot-phan-mem-gia-lap-Vi-du-NoxPlayer-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Tai-va-cai-dat-mot-phan-mem-gia-lap-Vi-du-NoxPlayer-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-1-Tai-va-cai-dat-mot-phan-mem-gia-lap-Vi-du-NoxPlayer-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5638\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: T\u1ea3i v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp (V\u00ed d\u1ee5 NoxPlayer)<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RL9GdzBGEozGFHxTXRSllWa0gPe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S7SRdkAxuosuAkxvb3xl2fqVgkb\">B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n t\u1ea3i m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android uy t\u00edn nh\u01b0 BlueStacks, LDPlayer, ho\u1eb7c NoxPlayer t\u1eeb trang ch\u1ee7 c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd. Sau khi t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1, h\u00e3y ti\u1ebfn h\u00e0nh c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m l\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-M2B1dIkCyosogIxL3LzlNI0Zg6u\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: M\u1edf CH Play trong gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp<\/h3>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XYqvdQPqPowuCxxFqBFlyneWg1g\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5639\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5639\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5639\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Mo-CH-Play-trong-gia-lap.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: M\u1edf CH Play trong gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Mo-CH-Play-trong-gia-lap.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Mo-CH-Play-trong-gia-lap-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Mo-CH-Play-trong-gia-lap-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Mo-CH-Play-trong-gia-lap-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-2-Mo-CH-Play-trong-gia-lap-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5639\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: M\u1edf CH Play trong gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FJSddxHmFoYcu3xnEh8lMHhvg7f\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PjQNdE6NDoJA5kxGumTlkT8zgFf\">Kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp v\u00e0 t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng <strong>CH Play (Google Play Store)<\/strong>. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd c\u1ea7n \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp b\u1eb1ng t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Google (Gmail) c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ec3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o kho \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DXZ3dptfyoQK2CxC5gCl38QXgPh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u00ecm v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee<\/h3>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8rAd9wRSo3RV5xvNbelAdAXgIg\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5640\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5640\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5640\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tim-va-cai-dat-ung-dung-Shopee.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u00ecm v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tim-va-cai-dat-ung-dung-Shopee.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tim-va-cai-dat-ung-dung-Shopee-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tim-va-cai-dat-ung-dung-Shopee-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tim-va-cai-dat-ung-dung-Shopee-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Buoc-3-Tim-va-cai-dat-ung-dung-Shopee-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5640\" class=\"wp-caption-text\"><em>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u00ecm v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee<\/em><\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SZbwdvs9roVwTsxJx0Sl4BpKggd\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XhyTdyUYeoB9xExWhlLlKwgUgyf\">Tr\u00ean thanh t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u1ee7a CH Play, g\u00f5 &#8220;Shopee&#8221; v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n Enter. Ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng Shopee v\u00e0 nh\u1ea5n <strong>&#8220;C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t&#8221; (Install)<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 v\u00e0 c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t v\u00e0o trong tr\u00ecnh gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JAqvdjL6PoKg7bxTX4MlOpQmg5g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FyVsdFzOkoagHtxxhyklTTuFgjd\">So s\u00e1nh: D\u00f9ng Shopee t\u1ea3i v\u1ec1 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh v\u00e0 d\u00f9ng tr\u00ean tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t web<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HjFAdMT0UoApruxXyROlaSQIgy7\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-LHaDd9NITosHgdxSIpRloU5egVf\" data-type=\"sheet\">\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"180\" \/>\n<col width=\"160\" \/>\n<col width=\"214\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>C\u00e1ch s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng<\/td>\n<td>\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/td>\n<td>Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t Shopee b\u1eb1ng Google Chrome (PWA)<\/td>\n<td>Ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng trong c\u1eeda s\u1ed5 ri\u00eang, c\u00f3 bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng tr\u00ean thanh t\u00e1c v\u1ee5, kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng nhanh h\u01a1n v\u00e0 gi\u1ea3m xao nh\u00e3ng t\u1eeb c\u00e1c tab kh\u00e1c.<\/td>\n<td>C\u1ea7n thao t\u00e1c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t ban \u0111\u1ea7u \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng PWA.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp tr\u00ean tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t web<\/td>\n<td>Kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t, truy c\u1eadp nhanh t\u1eeb b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh n\u00e0o.<\/td>\n<td>D\u1ec5 b\u1ecb l\u1eabn trong nhi\u1ec1u tab, g\u00e2y kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n cho vi\u1ec7c qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng qua tr\u00ecnh gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp<\/td>\n<td>Mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 100% t\u00ednh n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng di \u0111\u1ed9ng, k\u1ec3 c\u1ea3 t\u00ednh n\u0103ng ch\u01b0a t\u1ed1i \u01b0u tr\u00ean web.<\/td>\n<td>\u0110\u00f2i h\u1ecfi m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u00f3 c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh cao v\u00e0 ti\u00eau t\u1ed1n nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng.<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KwSydoMYNo0TFWx788Dlsd4Lg2o\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MFcddTSNKoa7OwxqVR4lQVdEgwc\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi th\u01b0\u1eddng g\u1eb7p<\/h2>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G4NddY3exoS1rdxS7MKlDHtdgSh\" start=\"1\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>Shopee c\u00f3 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c cho m\u00e1y t\u00ednh kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fz5XdruD3o9jxQxICxhlp8z4gMg\">Kh\u00f4ng, Shopee hi\u1ec7n ch\u01b0a ph\u00e1t h\u00e0nh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c (native app) cho h\u1ec7 \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh Windows hay macOS. Tuy nhi\u00ean, ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t b\u1eb1ng Google Chrome s\u1ebd t\u1ea1o ra m\u1ed9t tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m g\u1ea7n gi\u1ed1ng nh\u1ea5t v\u1edbi m\u1ed9t \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CMEwd6OgIoZNH4xakbul7M9jg9e\" start=\"2\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>D\u00f9ng Shopee tr\u00ean tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t c\u00f3 b\u1ecb ch\u1eadm kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DNf3dMIORooJ5YxOpe5lx9fPgMe\">Th\u00f4ng th\u01b0\u1eddng, vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Shopee tr\u00ean tr\u00ecnh duy\u1ec7t kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb ch\u1eadm v\u00e0 ph\u1ee5 thu\u1ed9c ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu v\u00e0o t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 m\u1ea1ng v\u00e0 c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. Tuy nhi\u00ean, m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t (qua Chrome) c\u00f3 c\u1ea3m gi\u00e1c ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh h\u01a1n m\u1ed9t ch\u00fat.<\/div>\n<ol class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IAWsdcA0Do7Od3xo0svlVPs1ghb\" start=\"3\">\n<li data-list=\"number\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3\"><strong>Tr\u00ecnh gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android c\u00f3 t\u1ed1n t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean m\u00e1y kh\u00f4ng?<\/strong><\/h3>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B5rldYMFho58Bext9bTlJx1rgFf\">C\u00f3, c\u00e1c ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android ti\u00eau t\u1ed1n kh\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u t\u00e0i nguy\u00ean h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 RAM v\u00e0 CPU. Ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p n\u00e0y ch\u1ec9 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u00f3 c\u1ea5u h\u00ecnh t\u1eeb t\u1ea7m trung tr\u1edf l\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m m\u01b0\u1ee3t m\u00e0.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U8h2daz6yobnzpxDmvklxSTCg2f\">Hy v\u1ecdng v\u1edbi b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y c\u1ee7a <strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong>, b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 hai <strong>c\u00e1ch t\u1ea3i Shopee tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PjmRdGD60oTJBsx5fkQl5xzHgxf\">M\u1ed7i c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec1u c\u00f3 nh\u1eefng \u01b0u \u0111i\u1ec3m ri\u00eang, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi c\u00e1c nhu c\u1ea7u kh\u00e1c nhau. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n m\u1ed9t gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p nhanh, nh\u1eb9 v\u00e0 ti\u1ec7n l\u1ee3i \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1eadp trung mua s\u1eafm, h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t c\u1ee7a Google Chrome.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UV6Ld9bUIo28AFxjSuzltBb1gIL\">N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 100% c\u00e1c t\u00ednh n\u0103ng c\u1ee7a \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng di \u0111\u1ed9ng, ph\u1ea7n m\u1ec1m gi\u1ea3 l\u1eadp Android s\u1ebd l\u00e0 l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, mi\u1ec5n l\u00e0 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ee7 m\u1ea1nh.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"QwP3dgQVKoACfDxytbelThdEgQe\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F0tBdWKc9ouVMkxbISmlScgIgif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"V0Kidqy2IocGzOxLzIxlADkBgoc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FnMpdlmeroUMmBxzO45lyb2Lg8f\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CiNPdL9yGogrOWx5SP9lClWZgQe\"><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXbIdAJxhoMK78xlitmlwna7gJi\"><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D4zHdkc9moG0p4xCDsMlPfuCgLg\"><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I1zOdpTlKoctbZx2CeclelbEgNe\"><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLSVdBWXkoC8WCxZhallVoJrgfc\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Shopee tr\u00ean m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh l\u1edbn kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua xem s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u01a1n m\u00e0 c\u00f2n h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 c\u00e1c nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd gian h\u00e0ng m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi c\u00e1c doanh nghi\u1ec7p mu\u1ed1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n vi\u1ec7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean s\u00e0n, c\u00e1c gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5726,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5634","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5634","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5634"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5634\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5691,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5634\/revisions\/5691"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5726"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5634"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5634"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5634"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}